   "pass_name": "prose",
   "answer": "{\n  \"blocks\": [\n    {\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"lines\": [\n        \"Thank you for instructing us to carry out the condition survey of Wharfside Court. Our team inspected both blocks between 15 and 19 September, with access to every communal area, the roof coverings of block A and eleven of the twelve flats you had arranged. The one flat we could not enter, 2B/07, was surveyed from the balcony and the corridor only.\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}",
