   }
  },
  {
   "pass_name": "prose",
   "answer": "{\n  \"blocks\": [\n    {\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"lines\": [\n        \"The enclosed report records our findings element by element. In summary, the structure of both blocks is sound and we found no evidence of continuing movement. The flat roof over block B has reached the end of its life: the membrane is blistered over roughly a third of its area and has failed at two outlets, which accounts for the staining reported in flats 3B/02 and 3B/03.\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}",
   "truncated": false,
   "error": null,
   "asked": {
